{"id":"c9d19622-66cc-4af9-8be6-318a0ba10504","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:26:30.995Z","batchId":"settings_qwen3-8-27b-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-27b-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <h1>Account Settings</h1>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Last updated Jun 12</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Profile -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Your public information as it appears across the platform.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:1.1rem;\">AK</div>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Alex Kimura</strong>\n              <div class=\"small muted\">alex.kimura@example.com</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"small\">\n            Display name\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"Alex Kimura\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"small\">\n            Email address\n            <input type=\"email\" value=\"alex.kimura@example.com\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"small\">\n            Bio\n            <textarea rows=\"3\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">Product designer focused on accessible interfaces. Based in Portland, OR. Coffee-driven.</textarea>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"small\">\n            Location\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"Portland, OR, USA\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"small\">\n            Timezone\n            <select style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n              <option selected>UTC−8 (Pacific)</option>\n              <option>UTC−5 (Eastern)</option>\n              <option>UTC+0 (GMT)</option>\n              <option>UTC+1 (CET)</option>\n              <option>UTC+9 (JST)</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"between center\">\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Changing your display name will update it across all workspaces.</div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Notifications -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose how and when you'd like to be notified.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Email — Product updates</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">New features, improvements, and release notes.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Email — Security alerts</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">Sign-in attempts, password changes, and suspicious activity.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-left:0;\">Security alerts are always on and cannot be disabled.</div>\n\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Email — Marketing</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">Promotions, partner offers, and community highlights.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Push — Mentions &amp; replies</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">Get notified when someone mentions or replies to you.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Push — Task deadlines</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">Reminders before assigned tasks are due.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Push — Daily digest</strong>\n            <div class=\"small muted\">A summary of activity across your workspaces at 9:00 AM.</div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label class=\"small\">\n          Digest frequency\n          <select style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n            <option>Daily at 9:00 AM</option>\n            <option>Weekly (Monday)</option>\n            <option>Weekly (Sunday)</option>\n            <option selected>Off</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"small\">\n          Quiet hours\n          <select style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n            <option selected>10 PM – 7 AM</option>\n            <option>9 PM – 6 AM</option>\n            <option>Off</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Privacy -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can see your information and how your data is used.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label class=\"small\">\n          Profile visibility\n          <select style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n            <option>Everyone</option>\n            <option selected>Workspace members</option>\n            <option>Only me</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"small\">\n          Show online status\n          <select style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n            <option selected>Visible to workspace</option>\n            <option>Visible to everyone</option>\n            <option>Hidden</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <h3 class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Two-factor authentication</h3>\n      <div class=\"between center\">\n        <div class=\"small muted\">\n          Currently using <strong>Authenticator app</strong>.\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Active</span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Manage</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <h3 class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Active sessions</h3>\n      <table class=\"small\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Device</th><th>Location</th><th>Last active</th><th></th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>MacBook Pro — Chrome</td>\n            <td>Portland, OR</td>\n            <td>Now</td>\n            <td><span class=\"badge\">Current</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>iPhone 15 — Safari</td>\n            <td>Portland, OR</td>\n            <td>2 h ago</td>\n            <td><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Revoke</button></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Windows 11 — Firefox</td>\n            <td>Seattle, WA</td>\n            <td>3 d ago</td>\n            <td><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Revoke</button></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\">\n        <div class=\"between center\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Delete account</strong>\n            <div class=\"small\">Permanently remove your account and all associated data. This action cannot be undone.</div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\">Delete…</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>","deltas":[[8084,"\n\n<div"],[8094," class"],[8116,"=\""],[8125,"page"],[8143,"\">"],[8160,"\n"],[8179," "],[8206," "],[8229,"<div"],[8251," class"],[8262,"=\""],[8272,"stack"],[8287," gap"],[8302,"-lg"],[8321,"\">"],[8338,"\n\n"],[8359,"   "],[8378," "],[8393,"<div"],[8409," class"],[8428,"=\""],[8447,"between"],[8465,"\">"],[8483,"\n"],[8499,"     "],[8517," "],[8534,"<div"],[8557,">"],[8573,"\n"],[8590,"       "],[8603," "],[8621,"<h"],[8648,"1"],[8660,">"],[8678,"Account"],[8698," Settings"],[8742,"</h"],[8752,"1"],[8762,">"],[8775,"\n"],[8792,"       "],[8808," "],[8843,"<p class"],[8856,"=\""],[8875,"m"],[8891,"uted"],[8908,"\">"],[8923,"Manage"],[8940," your"],[8958," profile"],[8977,","],[8992," notification"],[9009," preferences"],[9027,","],[9044," and"],[9061," privacy"],[9080," controls"],[9097,"."],[9132,"</p>"],[9145,"\n"],[9164,"     "],[9200," "],[9200,"</div"],[9213,">"],[9234,"\n"],[9246,"     "],[9277," "],[9286,"<span"],[9309," class"],[9317,"=\""],[9336,"badge"],[9860," badge"],[9871,"-secondary"],[